# Family constellation as an identity-preserving relationship graph

This layer uses “constellation” as a structural map, not as an oracle. Every
member remains a whole identity. Parent, child, sibling, partner, caregiver,
outsider, and absent describe relationships or viewpoints; none replaces what
a person is.

## Query

A family question carries:

    subject derivation
    WHAT / WHERE / WHEN / WHO / HOW / WHICH / WHY
    actor and target
    typed relationship
    named family boundary
    observation time
    proposed scalar claim or open question
    viewpoint
    grounding epoch and reasoning fuel

The answer remains one of:

    nothing | 0 | 1 | recursively-queryable node

The receipt separately carries the answer content, evidence kind, freshness,
agreement count, boundary, time, viewpoint, and native derivation.

The full witness recurses through four open planes:

    WHAT answer-node -> WHEN answer-node -> WHO answer-node -> HOW answer-node

Candidate WHERE questions then demonstrate 1 and 0, WHICH demonstrates
multi-source agreement as 1, and an unwitnessed WHY remains nothing.

## Boundaries

There is no single context-free family set. The first executable boundaries
are:

    biological
    legal
    household
    chosen
    remembered

A person can be inside one and outside another without contradiction. NOT is
therefore always `NOT(boundary, member-set)`.

A question cannot introduce an arbitrary boundary-shaped list: its boundary
node must already belong to the supplied family system.

## Evidence

Every relationship claim is marked:

    observed
    reported
    documented
    inferred
    imagined
    unknown

Only observed, reported, or documented evidence can become known-for-now in
this first slice, and even then it needs a valid opinion, matching identity,
proof, and a fresh witness. Inference and imagination remain meaningful
experiences with knowing status 0; the kernel does not promote intensity into
external fact.

This boundary matters because the empirical literature on Family Constellation
Therapy is limited. A 2021 systematic review reported possible benefits while
judging the quantity and overall quality of evidence low and noting minor or
moderate negative effects in a small share of participants in some studies:
https://doi.org/10.1111/famp.12636

A 2024 preregistered randomized trial adds evidence but does not turn a
participant's constellation impression into verified family history:
https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39053295/

## The twelve witnessed findings

1. One person can be biological family and not current household.
2. Chosen family can include someone outside biological lineage.
3. Parent direction is not reversible.
4. Sibling relation may be symmetric and order-independent.
5. One identity can be child in one edge and parent in another.
6. YOU becomes SELF when viewpoint rotates; the member identity does not move.
7. An observed ending does not erase lineage identity or membership.
8. NOT changes when the named family boundary changes.
9. Membership can change through time while identity stays stable.
10. Knowledge freshness ages while the relationship symbol remains stable.
11. Two provenance-distinct witnesses can agree without becoming one source.
12. A vivid imagined pattern remains knowing=0 until externally witnessed.

## Honest floor

The executable fixture is synthetic and exists to prove semantics, not to make
claims about any real family. It proves direct edges, not general kinship
closure; step-parent, adoption, guardianship, divorce, coercion, uncertainty
between competing histories, and consent-aware private storage remain further
layers.
